    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so permanent. like there's no \"rebuilding\" after this. everything i worked for, every friend i had... it's all just gone. i'm just tired of waking up every day and having to face the fact that i'm basically a stranger to everyone i once loved. it honestly feels like the world is better off without the drama i caused. like maybe it's just easier if i just wasn't around to make things awkward anymore.",
